      "text": "[9:00PM] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good leaving Oshodi through Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National, Via the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm and Ile-Zik.\n\nTraffic inwards Mangoro and Cement as well as Sule and Ashade/Capitol junctions all in good shape.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
